 RS03 pays for itself.","text":"Reformer Pilates is booming in Australia, but studio costs add up quickly. A single reformer class runs $35-50, and an unlimited membership sits at $180-260 per month. Over five years, the RS03 represents a fraction of the cost of regular studio practice — and it lives in your home."},"blocks":{"comp_1":{"type":"comparison","settings":{"label":"vs single class ($45 × 2/week)","value":"~$4,680 / 5yr"}},"comp_2":{"type":"comparison","settings":{"label":"vs unlimited membership ($220/mo)","value":"~$13,200 / 5yr"}},"comp_3":{"type":"comparison","settings":{"label":"vs premium studio ($320/mo)","value":"~$19,200 / 5yr"}},"comp_4":{"type":"comparison","settings":{"label":"RS03 (one-time)","value":"$3,490"}},"hi_1":{"type":"highlight","settings":{"number":"$9,710","label":"5-Year Savings vs Unlimited"}},"hi_2":{"type":"highlight","settings":{"number":"11mo","label":"Avg. Payback Period"}},"hi_3":{"type":"highlight","settings":{"number":"∞","label":"Unlimited Use, Forever"}}},"block_order":["comp_1","comp_2","comp_3","comp_4","hi_1","hi_2","hi_3"]},"sp_reviews":{"type":"sensol-reviews","settings":{"show_section":true,"label":"Verified Owners","title":"Trained by design."},"blocks":{"review_1":{"type":"review","settings":{"text":"The precision of this machine is unlike anything I've used before. It feels like it was designed specifically for how my body moves.","name":"Sarah M.","role":"Pilates Instructor"}},"review_2":{"type":"review","settings":{"text":"I didn't expect a piece of fitness equipment to change my entire morning routine. The quiet operation means I can train before anyone wakes up.","name":"James L.","role":"Architect"}},"review_3":{"type":"review","settings":{"text":"Sensol lives in my living room like a piece of sculpture. Guests always ask about it — and then they try it.","name":"Emma T.","role":"Interior Designer"}}},"block_order":["review_1","review_2","review_3"]},"sp_qa":{"type":"sensol-product-qa","settings":{"eyebrow":"Questions & Answers","title":"Common questions.","open_first":true},"blocks":{"qa_1":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"How long does shipping take?","answer":"We ship from our Sydney warehouse within 2-3 business days. Metro delivery typically arrives within 5-7 business days; regional areas may take 7-14 days. You'll receive a tracking link by email once dispatched."}},"qa_2":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"Do I need to assemble it myself?","answer":"No. The RS03 arrives fully assembled and tuned by a Sensol technician. Our white-glove delivery service includes in-home placement, level adjustment, and a 15-minute walkthrough of the spring system and rope adjusters."}},"qa_3":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"What is the warranty?","answer":"The frame carries a 10-year structural warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. The spring set, ropes, and upholstery are covered for 2 years. Normal wear on grip surfaces and finishes is not covered."}},"qa_4":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"Can it be used by multiple people at different heights?","answer":"Yes. The 5-point rope system accommodates users from approximately 150cm to 195cm without reconfiguration. The 4-position footbar covers most foot sizes and standing heights."}},"qa_5":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"What is the recommended floor space?","answer":"Allow 2.5m × 1.0m of clear floor space for full range of motion. The RS03 itself is 2.41m long. A ceiling height of 2.4m is sufficient for most standing exercises."}},"qa_6":{"type":"qa","settings":{"question":"Is financing available?","answer":"Yes. We offer Afterpay, Zip, and a 12-month interest-free plan through our payment partner. Apply at checkout — approval typically takes under 60 seconds."}}},"block_order":["qa_1","qa_2","qa_3","qa_4","qa_5","qa_6"]}},"order":["sensol-rs03-landing","sp_banner","sp_feature_1","sp_video","sp_specs","sp_included","sp_roi","sp_reviews","sp_qa"]}